            <div xml:id="d401">

                <pb facs="0382" n="372" sameAs="frus:frus1941v05/pg372"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">892.51/238: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Thailand</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Peck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-06T18:00:00-05:00">December 6, 1941—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>168. Your 549, December 4, 2 p.m. You may assure Thai authorities that extension
                    of a credit to Thailand for current needs is fully agreed to in principle, and
                    that Department expects no delay in <pb facs="0383" n="373" xml:id="pg373"/>
                    working out details with the appropriate lending agency of this Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
